  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qing Mao Mountain hands this range an open breach. Bai Ning Bing chased Fang Yuan through a wolf pack valley fight and killed Gu Yue Gu Masters along the way, which a Gu Yue Gu Master names a violation of the three clan alliance treaty.",
      "chapters": [
        134
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "evt_arc_qing_mao_mountain",
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "fac_gu_yue_clan",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Yue elders surround him for it, and Gu Yue Qing Shu is among those who face him.",
      "chapters": [
        140
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_yue_qing_shu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Divine Investigator’s arrival during the lightning lycan crisis, and what Gu Yue Bo already knows about it.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tie-investigation-opens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_gu_yue_bo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Xue Leng arrives as Divine Investigator with his daughter Tie Ruo Nan during the lightning lycan crisis; Gu Yue Bo already knows he has come for the murder investigation, and the inquiry opens the range.",
      "chapters": [
        170
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tie-investigation-opens",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_tie_xue_leng",
        "char_tie_ruo_nan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Xue Leng and Tie Ruo Nan judge Fang Yuan’s manner and speech after meeting him.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-nature-reading",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Xue Leng names Fang Yuan’s manner as demonic nature while his daughter analyzes Fang Yuan’s careful speech.",
      "chapters": [
        174
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-nature-reading",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gu Yue Bo’s bargain with Tie Xue Leng, the smashed Photo-audio Gu, and the Awakening Ceremony replay.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "photo-audio-gu-evidence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_photo_audio_gu",
        "sys_awakening_ceremony"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before showing evidence, clan leader Gu Yue Bo bargains with Tie Xue Leng for time so that if Fang Yuan is the killer he can still join the three-clan competition. After Tie agrees, Gu Yue Bo smashes the Photo-audio Gu and replays the Awakening Ceremony for the investigators.",
      "chapters": [
        180
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "photo-audio-gu-evidence",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Xue Leng reaches a blood pond scene on Qing Mao Mountain and calls out First gen Gu Yue, fighting a blood river python while Fang Yuan is caught in the blood water.",
      "chapters": [
        184
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blood-pond-confrontation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
        "char_first_gen_gu_yue"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "First gen Gu Yue uses Blood Skull Gu on Gu Yue clansmen to raise his own aptitude, then fights Bai Ning Bing’s Northern Dark Ice Soul physique inside a Blood Curtain Skyflower shield.",
      "chapters": [
        195
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-mountain-climax",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_demonic_blood_skull_gu",
        "sys_northern_dark_ice_soul_physique",
        "gu_blood_curtain_skyflower_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Trapped under ice between First gen Gu Yue and Lord Sky Crane, Fang Yuan uses Spring Autumn Cicada again and is reborn once more.",
      "chapters": [
        196
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-mountain-climax",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lord_sky_crane",
        "gu_spring_autumn_cicada"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After that rebirth he and Bai Ning Bing leave a Qing Mao Mountain turned into a desolate ice mountain, with the three great clans frozen, and set Bai Gu mountain as their next destination.",
      "chapters": [
        199
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "late-mountain-climax",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_bai_gu_mountain"
      ]
    }
  ],
